# Domain -> ark-studio.app (301, preserves path)
https://david-liu.pages.dev/* https://ark-studio.app/:splat 301
https://*.david-liu.pages.dev/* https://ark-studio.app/:splat 301
https://www.ark-studio.app/* https://ark-studio.app/:splat 301

# Locale-less paths -> default locale (the SPA still routes returning visitors by saved language)
/about /zh-tw/about 302
/portfolio /zh-tw/portfolio 302
/services /zh-tw/services 302
/contact /zh-tw/contact 302

# No SPA catch-all on purpose: every real URL is prerendered to a static file,
# and unknown URLs get the real 404.html (HTTP 404) instead of a soft-404 200.
